# SSL certificate domain list, one per line. Comments (#) and blank lines
# are ignored. The first non-comment line is the certbot lineage primary;
# subsequent lines are added as Subject Alternative Names (SANs) on the
# same cert.
#
# Wildcards (e.g. *.ops.uat.example.com) are supported because the SSL
# role uses DNS-01 challenge via Cloudflare API.
#
# Re-run the SSL playbook any time to add or remove domains; the lineage
# is pinned with --cert-name <primary> so each run replaces the list with
# whatever is in this file.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# UAT example (uncomment for the UAT VM):
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# uat.example.com
# uat.example.org
# *.uat.example.org
# *.ops.uat.example.com
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# Prod example (uncomment for the Prod VM):
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# example.com
# www.example.com
# example.org
# www.example.org
# *.example.org
# *.ops.example.com
